<view class="page">
 <view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">鸭</view><view><view class="brand-name">上岸鸭</view><text class="brand-sub">把计划变成真正完成的事</text></view></view>
 <view class="eyebrow">WELCOME BACK</view><view class="title">欢迎回来</view><view class="desc">继续完成今天想做的事。</view>
 <view class="field"><text class="field-label">手机号</text><view class="input-wrap"><text class="prefix">+86</text><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入注册手机号" placeholder-class="placeholder" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhone"/></view></view>
 <view class="field"><text class="field-label">登录密码</text><view class="input-wrap"><input class="input" password placeholder="请输入密码" placeholder-class="placeholder" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPassword"/></view></view>
 <view class="link right" bindtap="forgot">忘记密码？</view><view class="primary" bindtap="login">登录</view><view class="link" bindtap="toRegister">还没有账号？先创建账号</view>
 <view class="notice">一个手机号对应一个账号。密码错误不会进入工作台；忘记密码可通过短信验证重置。</view>
</view>